  "reverse_engineering": [
    "RAR5 at file offset 448000. SFX comment Setup=1.bat, Silent=1. Three members. Remaining 39315 bytes are entirely zero padding. No hidden tail payload.",
    "All 183 launcher bytes examined. echo off; cd /d to script directory; invoke xmrig --url pool.hashvault.pro:443 --user [95-character configured Monero wallet] --pass TEY. No encoding, fetched stage, persistence, injection, cleanup, or anti-analysis branch in batch.",
    "WinRing0 DriverEntry 0x15008 -> 0x11008 creates device and DOS link, registers dispatch 0x110d8. IOCTL 0x9c402084 reaches 0x11468 (input-selected RDMSR -> output buffer); 0x9c402088 reaches 0x1149c (input-selected WRMSR). Port I/O and HAL PCI configuration paths present. 0x11504 maps BIOS physical region with bounds 0xc0000..0xfffff, copies data, unmaps. Do not claim arbitrary physical-memory write from this read path.",
    "XMRig function 0x14018cbe0 resolves WinRing0x64.sys and opens/creates WinRing0_1_2_0 kernel service. CreateServiceW at 0x14018d1b2 uses SERVICE_KERNEL_DRIVER=1 and SERVICE_DEMAND_START=3, then StartServiceW. This is hardware tuning, not evidence of boot persistence or an exploit.",
    "XMRig 0x1400cf860 allocates 128 KiB RWX and prepares generated mining-code buffers. Retain executable-memory capability; no remote-process injection evidenced. IsDebuggerPresent callers at 0x1403f4590 and 0x1403f9c28 are CRT failure/exception paths, not analysis-targeted mining gates.",
    "Embedded OpenCL Groestl/Keccak source at 0x52e6a7/0x52e95a/0x535f88 supplies indexed XOR arithmetic. RSA ASN.1 type names at 0x464ee0/0x464f38 are in native OpenSSL type tables, not Go provenance or private-key theft."
  ],
  "judgment_context": "The customized batch supplies the actual mining task and payout identity for the silent SFX. This role, rather than the parent label, tips its judgment to MALICIOUS. Standalone bytes are also compatible with authorized mining; consent and original distribution lure are unavailable. Stock miner/driver bytes independently match official upstream and have no customization tying their inherent capabilities to hostile intent.",
